# Return/Refund Management & Void Sale Implementation

Implement two major features for the Electronics POS system: **Return/Refund Management** and **Void Sale Functionality**, with full inventory reversal, accounting safety, and audit trail.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Design Decision — Return Reversal vs Delete**: Returns are immutable once created. A "Return Reversal" is a separate audit-logged operation requiring Manager/Admin approval. We will NOT support deleting return records.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Void + Payments**: When voiding a sale that has existing payments, we will **block the void** and redirect to the refund flow. This is the safest accounting approach (no silent refunds).

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Manager approval for voiding completed sales**: Controlled via a [SystemSetting](file:///d:/Projects/electronics_pos/app/models.py#396-420) key `void_completed_requires_approval` (default `'true'`). When enabled, only Admin/Manager roles can void completed sales.

